<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>For Al Fatih Cayser Usman ♡</title>
<meta name="theme-color" content="#07152f">
<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@400;500;600;700&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');

*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{
  margin:0; color:#f5f7ff; background:#061126;
  font-family:"DM Sans",sans-serif; overflow-x:hidden;
}
body:before{
  content:""; position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:-3;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 20% 15%,rgba(102,158,255,.22),transparent 28%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 80% 70%,rgba(130,91,255,.16),transparent 30%),
    linear-gradient(180deg,#081a3c 0%,#061126 55%,#030916 100%);
}
.stars,.stars:before,.stars:after{
  position:fixed; inset:0; content:""; pointer-events:none; z-index:-1;
  background-image:radial-gradient(#fff 1px,transparent 1px);
  background-size:73px 73px; opacity:.23;
}
.stars:before{background-size:113px 113px; opacity:.12; transform:translate(20px,30px)}
.stars:after{background-size:157px 157px; opacity:.08; transform:translate(-30px,-20px)}
section{min-height:100svh; padding:80px 22px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; position:relative}
.wrap{width:min(760px,100%); margin:auto; text-align:center}
.eyebrow{letter-spacing:.25em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:.72rem;opacity:.68}
h1,h2,h3{font-family:"Cormorant Garamond",serif;font-weight:600;margin:.2em 0}
h1{font-size:clamp(3.2rem,14vw,7rem);line-height:.88}
h2{font-size:clamp(2.5rem,10vw,5rem);line-height:.95}
p{line-height:1.8;font-size:1rem;color:#dfe7f9}
.moon{
  width:145px;height:145px;border-radius:50%;margin:0 auto 28px;
  background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%,#fff,#cbd9ff 48%,#7185bd 100%);
  box-shadow:0 0 55px rgba(188,211,255,.32),0 0 110px rgba(102,151,255,.14);
}
.btn{
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25); background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  color:#fff; padding:14px 22px; border-radius:999px; cursor:pointer;
  backdrop-filter:blur(10px); font:inherit; transition:.25s;
}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);background:rgba(255,255,255,.13)}
.scroll{margin-top:36px;font-size:.75rem;opacity:.55;letter-spacing:.15em}
.card{
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.055); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);
  border-radius:28px; padding:28px; backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
  box-shadow:0 18px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.22);
}
.polaroid{
  background:#f8f5ed; padding:12px 12px 42px; width:min(420px,88vw);
  margin:32px auto; transform:rotate(-2deg); box-shadow:0 18px 45px rgba(0,0,0,.38);
}
.polaroid img{display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover}
.polaroid .caption{color:#19243c;font-family:"Cormorant Garamond",serif;font-size:1.35rem;margin-top:10px}
.message{margin:18px 0;text-align:left}
.message p{margin:0}
.quote{font-family:"Cormorant Garamond",serif;font-size:1.65rem;line-height:1.35;color:#fff}
.small{font-size:.82rem!important;opacity:.7}
.divider{width:60px;height:1px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.35);margin:26px auto}
.heart{font-size:2rem;animation:pulse 1.7s infinite}
@keyframes pulse{50%{transform:scale(1.16)}}
.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px);transition:1s ease}
.reveal.show{opacity:1;transform:none}
.music{
  position:fixed; right:15px; top:15px; z-index:20; display:flex; gap:8px;
  align-items:center; background:rgba(5,14,34,.72); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);
  padding:8px 10px; border-radius:999px; backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
}
.music button{border:0;background:none;color:#fff;font-size:1.1rem;cursor:pointer}
#intro{overflow:hidden}
#intro .hint{margin-top:24px;opacity:.68}
.floating{position:absolute;animation:float 5s ease-in-out infinite;opacity:.7}
.f1{left:9%;top:18%}.f2{right:11%;top:30%;animation-delay:1.5s}.f3{left:17%;bottom:18%;animation-delay:3s}
@keyframes float{50%{transform:translateY(-14px)}}
footer{padding:55px 22px 80px;text-align:center;opacity:.75}
@media (max-width:480px){section{padding:70px 18px}.card{padding:22px}.quote{font-size:1.45rem}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="stars"></div>

<div class="music">
  <button id="musicBtn" aria-label="Putar musik">♫</button>
  <span id="musicText" class="small">music</span>
  <audio id="audio" loop preload="none">
    <!-- Taruh file musik milikmu bernama "music.mp3" di folder yang sama dengan index.html -->
    <source src="music.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
  </audio>
</div>

<section id="intro">
  <div class="floating f1">✦</div><div class="floating f2">✧</div><div class="floating f3">⋆</div>
  <div class="wrap reveal">
    <div class="moon"></div>
    <div class="eyebrow">a little birthday gift</div>
    <h1>For Al Fatih</h1>
    <p>something small, but made especially for you.</p>
    <button class="btn" onclick="document.getElementById('today').scrollIntoView()">Open your gift ♡</button>
    <div class="scroll">SCROLL SLOWLY ↓</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="today">
  <div class="wrap reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow">19 september</div>
    <h2>Today is All About You</h2>
    <div class="divider"></div>
    <p>
      Today is about you. About another year you’ve successfully made it through,
      about everything you’ve been through, and about all the good things that are still waiting for you ahead.
    </p>
    <p>
      May in this new chapter of your life, you always have a reason to smile
      and are always surrounded by things that make you happy &lt;3
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow">a little memory</div>
    <div class="polaroid">
      <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Foto Al Fatih">
      <div class="caption">one of my favorite memories ♡</div>
    </div>
    <p class="small">Some moments deserve a little place to stay.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap reveal">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="heart">♡</div>
      <div class="message"><p>
        I just want you to know, harus ki tau kalo kita itu berarti sekalii buat saya,
        mungkin nda selalu ka bisa kasi liatki lewat kata kata, tapi selaluka hargai keberadaan ta,
        perhatian ta, dan setiap hal kecil yang dilakukan.
      </p></div>
      <p class="quote">You mean more to me than you know.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow">for your 14th</div>
    <h2>Happy Birthday, sayangg.</h2>
    <div class="divider"></div>
    <div class="card">
      <p>
        Selamat ulang tahun, sayangg. Mungkin nda pintar ka ungkapkan apa yang kurasa,
        tapi hari ini mau ka bilang kaloo bersyukur ka bisa kenal ki dan jadi bagian dari di hidup taa.
        Makasii untuk waktu ta, cerita, perhatian ta ke saya dan makasii suda selalu sabar hadapi ego ku.
      </p>
      <p>
        Semoga di umur ta yang ke 14 tahun ini, bisaki capai apa yang di impikan.
        Semoga selalu ki diberi kesehatan, dimudahkan setiap langkah ta,
        dan dikelilingi orang-orang baik &gt;_&lt;
      </p>
      <p class="quote">I'm really happy to have you in my life.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="last">
  <div class="wrap reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow">one last thing</div>
    <h2>One Last Thing</h2>
    <div class="polaroid" style="transform:rotate(2deg)">
      <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Foto kenangan">
      <div class="caption">thank you for being here.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <p>
        Terima kasii sudaa hadir di hidup kuu dan jadi orangg yang paling berarti buat sayaa.
        Semoga selalu ki bahagia, selalu sehat dan apa yang di inginkan bisa tercapai.
        Selamat bertambah usia, sayangg.
      </p>
      <p>
        Semogaa tahun ini jadi tahun yang baik untuk kita,
        <strong>I Love You !</strong>
      </p>
      <div class="heart">♥</div>
      <p class="small">— Mutia, with love.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <div class="heart">♡</div>
  Made especially for <strong>Al Fatih Cayser Usman</strong>
</footer>

<script>
const reveals = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');
const observer = new IntersectionObserver(entries=>{
  entries.forEach(e=>{if(e.isIntersecting)e.target.classList.add('show')});
},{threshold:.15});
reveals.forEach(el=>observer.observe(el));

const audio=document.getElementById('audio');
const btn=document.getElementById('musicBtn');
const txt=document.getElementById('musicText');
btn.addEventListener('click', async ()=>{
  try{
    if(audio.paused){await audio.play();btn.textContent='❚❚';txt.textContent='playing'}
    else{audio.pause();btn.textContent='♫';txt.textContent='music'}
  }catch(err){
    txt.textContent='add music.mp3';
  }
});
</script>
</body>
</html>
